# `live` is cut from this directory verbatim (see bin/make-live), which
# stages it with .live/ as git's work tree — so this is the only ignore file
# that run consults. The repository root's never applies here, and without
# this one the Finder's droppings publish to the live site.
#
# This file travels to `live` along with the rest of the tree, deliberately:
# bin/make-live's promise is that the branch *is* this directory, and an
# ignore file that hid itself would quietly make the branch a subset of it —
# the one drift the tests here exist to catch. It is listed in
# test/live/placeholder.test.js's manifest for the same reason.

.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
